<title>JAPAN: Hitachi - 6mth group results (SEC).</title>
<headline>Hitachi - 6mth group results (SEC).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.08 trln	 vs	    3.89 trln</p>
<p> Current	    105.70		vs	  151.70</p>
<p> Net		   33.60		vs	   57.70</p>
<p> EPS		    9.83 yen	  vs	   16.53 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hitachi Ltd is a leading electric machinery maker.</p>
<p>(Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
